2026-10-17T19:49:14.9758487Z options:
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9758711Z   -h, --help            show this help message and exit
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9759081Z   -q, --query QUERY     Query to run. On a real TTY the prompt seeds an
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9759498Z                         interactive session (submitted literally as the first
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9759896Z                         turn); combined with --oneshot or -Q, or on a non-TTY,
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9760228Z                         it answers and exits.
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9760577Z   --query-file PATH     Read the single query from a file instead of the
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9823167Z                         command line ('-' reads stdin). Safe for arbitrary
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9823656Z                         text: nothing is shell-interpreted, so quotes, $(...),
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9824047Z                         and backticks are preserved verbatim. Mutually
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9824360Z                         exclusive with -q.
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9824699Z   --oneshot             With -q/--query-file: answer the query and exit
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9825084Z                         (legacy single-query behavior) instead of seeding an
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9825871Z                         interactive session. Implied on non-TTY stdio and by
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9826189Z                         -Q/--quiet.
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9826524Z   --image IMAGE         Optional local image path to attach to a single query
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9827157Z   -m, --model MODEL     Model to use (e.g., anthropic/claude-sonnet-4)
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9827507Z   -t, --toolsets TOOLSETS
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9827750Z                         Comma-separated toolsets to enable
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9828133Z   --reasoning LEVEL     Reasoning effort for this session: none, minimal, low,
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9828594Z                         medium, high, xhigh, max, or ultra. Overrides
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9828957Z                         agent.reasoning_effort for this run only (same levels
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9829299Z                         as the /reasoning slash command).
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9829661Z   -s, --skills SKILLS   Preload one or more skills for the session (repeat
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9830029Z                         flag or comma-separate)
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9830387Z   --provider PROVIDER   Inference provider (default: auto). Built-in or a
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9831001Z                         user-defined name from `providers:` in config.yaml.
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9831331Z   -v, --verbose         Verbose output
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9831650Z   -Q, --quiet           Quiet mode for programmatic use: suppress banner,
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9832029Z                         spinner, and tool previews. Only output the final
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9832351Z                         response and session info.
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9832620Z   --format {text,stream-json}
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9832910Z                         Output format for single-query mode (-q). 'text'
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9833268Z                         prints the final response as plain text (default).
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9833631Z                         'stream-json' emits newline-delimited JSON events
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9834004Z                         (JSONL), implies --quiet, and cannot be combined with
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9834324Z                         --tui.
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9834543Z   --resume, -r SESSION_ID
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9834811Z                         Resume a previous session by ID (shown on exit), or
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9835149Z                         'latest' for the most recent session
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9835522Z   --no-restore-cwd      Don't cd into a resumed session's recorded working
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9835858Z                         directory.
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9836166Z   --in DIR              Change into DIR before starting or resuming (scopes '
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9836558Z                         --resume latest' / -c lookups to DIR's workspace).
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9836876Z   --continue, -c [SESSION_NAME]
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9837343Z                         Resume a session by name, or the most recent if no
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9837645Z                         name given
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9837978Z   --create-if-missing   With -c/--continue <name>: if no session matches the
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9838413Z                         name, create a new session with that title and proceed
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9838771Z                         (instead of failing with a not-found error).
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9839120Z                         Programmatic callers that want 'send to this named
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9839450Z                         thread, making it if needed'.
2026-10-17T19:49:14.9839805Z   --worktree, -w        Run in an isolated git worktree (for parallel agents
